{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and defend your dungeon in a strategic roguelite tower defense with board-game mechanics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your troops, place traps and special rooms, and withstand relentless waves of enemies eager to overthrow your reign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907320/extras/71e781d71f223e79928efb393a4415d8.poster.avif?t=1771519422\" width=1170 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907320/extras/71e781d71f223e79928efb393a4415d8.webm?t=1771519422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907320/extras/71e781d71f223e79928efb393a4415d8.mp4?t=1771519422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Choose Your Lord!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lords are the heart of <i>Kings Origin</i>: a vibrant cast of more than six characters, each with unique abilities, personalities, and motivations.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight head-on with your Lord on the frontlines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design a labyrinth filled with traps and deceptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or empower your minions to defend your domain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every strategy is viable. How far will your ambition take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907320/extras/5846290d381ed619fc2703b972d2a135.poster.avif?t=1771519422\" width=1170 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907320/extras/5846290d381ed619fc2703b972d2a135.webm?t=1771519422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907320/extras/5846290d381ed619fc2703b972d2a135.mp4?t=1771519422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6\u00a0Create Your Own Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your destiny day by day with decisions that change every run:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching paths</strong> with battles, events, or ambushes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fate cards</strong> that define your daily choices: fight, surprise, or reward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique relics</strong> and hidden secrets that transform your tactics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Careful planning is key: one misplaced room or trap could be your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907320/extras/0dec68dbcf1fb26832607d045cd56292.poster.avif?t=1771519422\" width=1170 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907320/extras/0dec68dbcf1fb26832607d045cd56292.webm?t=1771519422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907320/extras/0dec68dbcf1fb26832607d045cd56292.mp4?t=1771519422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 CONTENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6+ <strong>Lords</strong> with special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of <strong>units, heroes, and beasts</strong> to command.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable traps and rooms</strong> for your dungeon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Events</strong> filled with twists and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious relics</strong> that change every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metaprogression</strong> to unlock permanent upgrades and expand your reign.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rule with cunning, forge an unbreakable defense, and let your dungeon thrive in a world where only the sharpest minds survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Initial Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/96e82582929a04ac611b4ec1d552574d443ea18b.jpg"},{"name":"Vigil of Twenty Days","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/7e6e0595f9cd0da2b4cbc4d3f11d2d4b96070483.jpg"},{"name":"Lead the Cid Campeador","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/d083f79e324f2ee3f59e662a6caca73e1d821a3d.jpg"},{"name":"The Deed of the Campeador","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/fd035212d497dfe83d6d844560594d80587c5d18.jpg"},{"name":"Troop Forge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/aaa188b579ed575b2eda1f6915d8fafeb0077bf5.jpg"},{"name":"Roots Revealed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/96e82582929a04ac611b4ec1d552574d443ea18b.jpg"},{"name":"Roadside Surprise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/dd1eefeff4c3d872a63478a8050861861f7f01c2.jpg"},{"name":"Trial of Forty Nights","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/7e6e0595f9cd0da2b4cbc4d3f11d2d4b96070483.jpg"},{"name":"Under Isabel\u2019s Cross","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/