d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique relics</strong> and hidden secrets that transform your tactics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Careful planning is key: one misplaced room or trap could be your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907320/extras/0dec68dbcf1fb26832607d045cd56292.poster.avif?t=1771519422\" width=1170 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907320/extras/0dec68dbcf1fb26832607d045cd56292.webm?t=1771519422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907320/extras/0dec68dbcf1fb26832607d045cd56292.mp4?t=1771519422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 CONTENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6+ <strong>Lords</strong> with special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of <strong>units, heroes, and beasts</strong> to command.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable traps and rooms</strong> for your dungeon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Events</strong> filled with twists and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious relics</strong> that change every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metaprogression</strong> to unlock permanent upgrades and expand your reign.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rule with cunning, forge an unbreakable defense, and let your dungeon thrive in a world where only the sharpest minds survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","developers":["Nerve Link"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id